# Tokens

Single source: `src/PlayUp/web/src/design-system/` (scoped to `.ds-root`).
Primitives (`palettes/slate.css`) feed semantic tokens (`tokens/*.css`).
**Always use semantic tokens** (`--color-*`, `--space-*`, `--radius-*`,
`--shadow-*`, `--text-*`); never primitives, never raw hex in components.

## Color roles

- Canvas `--color-canvas` / Surface `--color-surface` / Surface secondary.
- Text: `--color-text-primary` / `--color-text-secondary`.
- Brand `--color-brand` (+hover) — actions and brand accents only.
- Semantic: `success`, `attention` (pending work), `error` (failures), `info`.
- Chrome: `--color-chrome` (dark navy) + `on-chrome` + `chrome-accent` —
  **reserved to the navigation rail**; never for content panels.
- Live: green `success` family + pulse dot (see 09-motion).

## Forbidden / legacy

- The legacy palette in `src/index.css` (`#3452d8`, Segoe UI, pills, page
  shadows) is **dead**: never reference it in new UI.
- No new hex values, no `color-mix()` improvisations outside the token files.
- No new spacing/radius/shadow values: use the existing scale
  (`--space-4/8/12/16/24/32`, `--radius-control/panel`, `--shadow-*`).

If a needed token does not exist, stop and flag it instead of hardcoding.
